    <item>
      <title>Images &amp; SVGs</title>
      <link>/blogs/online-tools/img-svg/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/blogs/online-tools/img-svg/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;svg&#34;&gt;SVG&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;bookmarks-0&#34; class=&#34;van-img-grid van-img-grid-large&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;script type=&#34;module&#34;&gt;&#xA;import { renderImgGrid } from &#39;/js/img-grid.js&#39;;&#xA;&#xA;try {&#xA;  renderImgGrid(&#39;bookmarks-0&#39;, &#34;\n\n- href: https:\/\/boxy-svg.com\/app\n  img: \/images\/boxy-svg.svg\n  title: Boxy SVG\n  description: |\n    Very powerful SVG editor. Use download to save to local storage.\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.svgator.com\/create-svg\n  img: \/images\/svgator.svg\n  title: SVGator\n  description: Draw SVG, edit and easily export. Focus on animation!\n\n- href: https:\/\/vectorink.io\/\n  img: \/images\/vector-ink.svg\n  title: VectorInk\n  description: Powerful tools for creating, editing SVG files.\n\n- href: https:\/\/svgedit.netlify.app\n  img: \/images\/svgedit-logo.svg\n  title: SVG-Edit\n  description: |\n    Web-based open source SVG editor.\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.online-image-editor.com\n  img: \/images\/online-image-editor.svg\n  title: Online Image Editor\n  description: Highly recommended\n    for resizing, cropping, converting, framing with round corners,\n    adding text to images. Easy to use.\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.photopea.com\n  img: \/images\/photopea.svg\n  title: photopea\n  description: \u003e\n    Free online alternative to photoshop, same capabale and difficult.\n    It runs completely locally in your browser.\n\n- href: https:\/\/vecta.io\/\n  img: \/images\/vecta-io.svg\n  title: vecta.io\n  description: visio-like, maybe more suitable to draw flowchat\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.canva.com\/features\/svg-editor\/\n  img: \/images\/canva.svg\n  title: Canva free SVG editor\n  description: component-based design tool, to be investigated.\n\n- href: https:\/\/drawsvg.org\/\n  img: \/images\/drawsvg.svg\n  title: DrawSVG.org\n  description: SVG drawing editor with additional tools\n       for generating, optimizing, converting your drawings and sharing them\n       with a community. It is also available as a desktop application on github.\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.adobe.com\/express\/feature\/image\/crop\n  img: \/images\/adobe.svg\n  title: Adobe Express Image Cropper\n  description: Easy to use for basic functions, but limited functions for free uses.\n\n- href: https:\/\/www5.lunapic.com\/editor\/?action=save\n  img: \/images\/lunapic-bw.png\n  title: LunaPic\n  description: Another full capable free online image editor.\n      But you may not get used to its UI and workflow.\n\n&#34;,&#xA;    {&#xA;        size: &#34;large&#34;&#xA;    }&#xA;  );&#xA;} catch (e) {&#xA;  console.error(&#39;Error rendering img-grid:&#39;, e);&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;repos&#34;&gt;Repos&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div id=&#34;bookmarks-1&#34; class=&#34;van-img-grid van-img-grid-large&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;script type=&#34;module&#34;&gt;&#xA;import { renderImgGrid } from &#39;/js/img-grid.js&#39;;&#xA;&#xA;try {&#xA;  renderImgGrid(&#39;bookmarks-1&#39;, &#34;\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.vecteezy.com\/\n  img: \/images\/vecteezy.svg\n  title: Vecteezy\n  description: Download Free Vectors, Clip Art Designs, Vector Images \u0026amp; Icons\n\n- href: https:\/\/www.svgrepo.com\n  img: \/images\/svgrepo.svg\n  title: SVG Repo\n\n- href: https:\/\/fontawesome.com\/?utm_source=freestuffdev\n  img: \/images\/fontawesome.svg\n  title: Font Awesome\n\n&#34;,&#xA;    {&#xA;        size: &#34;large&#34;&#xA;    }&#xA;  );&#xA;} catch (e) {&#xA;  console.error(&#39;Error rendering img-grid:&#39;, e);&#xA;}&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;</description>
    </item>
